<section id="A1.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.4 </span>Comparative results of HashAttention vs. Others </h3>

<div id="A1.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The results are presented in Table <a href="#A1.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ A.4 Comparative results of HashAttention vs. Others ‣ Appendix A Additional Experiments Results and Details ‣ vAttention: Verified Sparse Attention" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a></p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T9" class="ltx_table">
